# Large databases (BLAST binary indices + sequence sources). Their exact state is
# recorded in database_CHECKSUMS.sha256 (tracked) and they are rebuildable via
# scripts/build/. gene_catalog.json — small config that drives ORF validation and
# locus selection — is kept under version control.
database/*
!database/gene_catalog.json
!database/exon_templates.json
!database/boundary_db

